bosses or single-target encounters."}],"a":[{"names":["Nymph's Dream"],"text":"Grants up to 25% ATK and 30% total Hydro DMG Bonus through its set effects. Tartaglia's best general set.","stats":"ATK% · Hydro DMG · CR/CD"},{"names":["Heart of Depth"],"text":"Boosts Hydro damage and strengthens Normal and Charged Attacks after using his Skill. A reliable alternative.","stats":""},{"names":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"text":"Niche set only when Lunar Reaction and Moonsign conditions activate its CRIT Rate bonus; not a default International set.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Ginger Snaps","members":["Tartaglia","Nicole","Durin","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Tartaglia supplies Hydro for Durin's off-field Pyro damage, while Nicole buffs and shields and Kazuha groups enemies.","roles":["On-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Shielder / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Waterboarding","members":["Tartaglia","Columbina","Ineffa","Citlali"],"text":"Columbina and Ineffa enable Lunar-Charged damage, while Citlali adds shielding and Hydro resistance shred.","roles":["On-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Shielder","Shielder / Buffer"]},{"name":"Childe, Please","members":["Tartaglia","Furina","Escoffier","Citlali"],"text":"Furina provides damage and buffs, Escoffier heals and shreds resistance, and Citlali adds shielding and Freeze support.","roles":["On-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Support","Shielder / Buffer"]},{"name":"Childe Support","members":["Tartaglia","Bennett","Xiangling","Sucrose"],"text":"Tartaglia enables Xiangling's Vaporize damage, while Bennett buffs and heals and Sucrose groups enemies and shreds resistance.","roles":["On-field Driver / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"International Vaporize: Enable Xiangling's Vaporize damage with rapid Hydro application. Keep melee rotations short to manage Skill cooldown.\nBurst Nuke: Focus on Burst damage and some EM for powerful Vaporized nukes. Use a suitable Pyro setup before casting Burst.\nRiptide AoE: Prioritize CRIT Rate and enemy grouping to spread Riptide through tightly packed enemies.\nBudget Vaporize: Use Chain Breaker with Xiangling, Bennett, and Sucrose for accessible Vaporize damage without premium weapons.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["DPS"],"about":"Tartaglia is a fast paced Hydro DPS who excels at reaction-driven teams and devastating AoE damage through Riptide. If you love chaos ginger energy, he's meant for you.","pros":["Excellent Hydro application","Strong AoE damage","Reaction enabler","Flexible teams"],"cons":["Cooldown management","Rotation dependent","Lower single-target","Wants investment"],"weapons":["Polar Star","Thundering Pulse","Hunter's Path","Skyward Harp","Aqua Simulacra","The Viridescent Hunt","Chain Breaker","Blackcliff Warbow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Nymph's Dream"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Lunar Charged Only"}],"main":["ATK%","Hydro DMG","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["CRIT Rate: 70% - 80%","CRIT DMG: 180%+","ATK: 1,800 - 2,100+","Energy Recharge: 110% - 130%"],"vars":[{"title":"International Vaporize","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Polar Star","Skyward Harp","The Viridescent Hunt"],"arts":[{"sets":["Nymph's Dream"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Hydro DMG / CRIT, with enough ER for Burst.","teams":"Xiangling plus Bennett and an Anemo buffer.","when":"Enable Xiangling Vaporize while driving Riptide Hydro damage.","cond":"Manage Skill duration to avoid excessive cooldown.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Burst Vaporize Nuke","role":"Quickswap DPS","weapons":["Polar Star","Aqua Simulacra"],"arts":[{"sets":["Nymph's Dream"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"CRIT and ATK, with EM if Burst Vaporizes.","teams":"Reliable Pyro aura before a Vaporized Burst.","when":"Prioritize a high-impact Burst over long melee uptime.","cond":"Elemental aura timing determines Vaporize.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Riptide AoE","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Polar Star","The Viridescent Hunt"],"arts":[{"sets":["Nymph's Dream"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Hydro DMG / CRIT.","teams":"Grouping and clustered enemies.","when":"Exploit overlapping Riptide hits in multi-target fights.","cond":"Less effective against isolated targets.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Varunada Lazurite Sliver","Varunada Lazurite Fragment","Varunada Lazurite Chunk","Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","Cleansing Heart","Teachings of Freedom","Guide to Freedom","Philosophies of Freedom","Recruit's Insignia","Sergeant's Insignia","Lieutenant's Insignia","Starconch","Shard of a Foul Legacy","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 6-8"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Ginger Snaps","members":["Tartaglia","Nicole","Durin","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Waterboarding","members":["Tartaglia","Columbina","Ineffa","Citlali"]},{"name":"Childe, Please","members":["Tartaglia","Furina","Escoffier","Citlali"]},{"name":"Childe Support","members":["Tartaglia","Bennett","Xiangling","Sucrose"]}]}}],"title":"Tartaglia","el":"Hydro"}